  "title": "Anime Audio Drama Surge Saga",
  "subtitle": "Surge Saga",
  "description": "Surge Saga is an anime themed audio drama. Isaac, along with this two friends Moe and Jamal, have obtained these new abilities thanks to spiritual objects called Surge Cores. With these new powers, they rushed into the unknown and encountered an evil old saga. Having lost, Isaac is now cursed. The group is aided by Nick and Joan who are from two different Surge Temples. They seek to find a solution to Isaac's current situation while still figuring out a way to take down the evil sage. This audio book airs once a month, every third Friday of the month. Join the discord and facebook page for updates. Join us on discord at the Fumbling 4 Network - https://discord.com/channels/1225434256893804666/1236012225819443270 Join our facebook page - https://www.facebook.com/jantonyfernandez/",
